{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, creatorName, packageName, orderId, autoAcceptAt, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}}, 👋</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Your review window is closing ⏳</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  {{creatorName}} delivered <strong>"{{packageName}}"</strong> and it's still waiting on you. If you take no action, we'll approve it automatically on <strong>{{autoAcceptAt}}</strong> and release the creator's payment.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Happy with it? You don't need to do anything. Want changes? Request a revision before then and the clock stops.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fdf2f8;border:2px solid #181313;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#111827;">
    <strong>Order</strong> {{orderId}}<br />
    <strong>Approves automatically on</strong> {{autoAcceptAt}}
  </p>
</div>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Review the content →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team 💗</p>
